model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway.accountRuntime {
    metadata {
      constraint "Account health and identity lists deduplicate identities and bind PostgreSQL text ID sets as one parameter; MySQL keeps native parameter comparisons for column collation and lossless values. Batched metadata preserves request-local owner and placement checks without caching authorization. The lifecycle placement import composes after earlier automatic-check imports without a start-of-file anchor. Hosted server and its query fixture declare the workspace SQL helper dependency so isolated package and image builds resolve it. App directory provisioning keeps the five-second pending-app cadence only while pending; settled directories return to bounded account reconciliation. Server reads remain reactive and initial reads start before reconciliation; only observed failures or prolonged pending health back off. Mounted account reads share a bounded cadence that backs off unavailable or prolonged pending health. The hosted server declares the workspace SQL helper beside the pinned auth and Effect dependencies, so the batched query path resolves in isolated package builds without replacing the current auth overlays."
    }
  }
}
